# Paths under /etc/nginx that must NOT exist on the origin: files this
# repository once installed and has since renamed or dropped. push-nginx.sh
# never deletes what is not in the repository on its own, so a vhost that is
# only renamed here would go on serving there. It reports every path below
# that is still present, and --apply moves each aside (as *.bak.<stamp>, with
# its sites-enabled link for a vhost) in the same pass and under the same
# restore as everything else it installs.
#
# One path per line; a line is removed from here only once no host could
# still have it.

# Renamed to sites-available/cloud.openipc.share when share.openipc.org was
# retired for share.openipc.cloud (2026-09-30).
sites-available/org.openipc.share
